WEBVTT

00:14.630 --> 00:19.600
The sweet whispers of love only happen twice.

00:20.830 --> 00:25.970
Before you know it, you're taken prisoner. Chocolat à la folie.

00:27.470 --> 00:32.390
The stardust of dawn is inlaid in the sky.

00:33.850 --> 00:38.820
My emerald eyes have you in their sights!

00:40.250 --> 00:45.030
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Choco Rune!

00:46.630 --> 00:51.470
The sparkling hearts are secret jewels.

00:52.950 --> 00:58.220
Even if the boys bully you,

00:59.370 --> 01:04.370
They've just fallen in love. Chocolat à la folie.

01:05.880 --> 01:10.860
They're really in love with you. Chocolat à la folie.

01:23.390 --> 01:25.200
Chocolat à la folie.

01:31.020 --> 01:33.080
Dar-ling...

01:34.950 --> 01:36.120
Daaaarling?

01:39.190 --> 01:40.460
Darling?

01:42.190 --> 01:43.960
Hey, Darling!

01:47.400 --> 01:49.480
Waffle?!

01:49.480 --> 01:51.040
Good morning,

01:51.670 --> 01:52.700
Darling.

01:53.310 --> 01:55.240
W-why are you in my room?

01:55.240 --> 01:57.740
For the sake of my future husband,

01:57.740 --> 01:59.810
I put my heart into making this...

01:59.810 --> 02:01.810
A Breakfast of Love!

02:03.650 --> 02:07.750
Waffle-sama's cooking is
overflowing with love.

02:08.120 --> 02:10.890
Umm... I really shouldn't eat
something like that this early.

02:10.890 --> 02:14.490
That's bad! You have to eat properly
to maintain your health!

02:14.790 --> 02:16.290
Go ahead! Eat up!

02:21.470 --> 02:25.000
Chocolat & Vanilla
& The Star of Dreams.

02:28.440 --> 02:30.170
Bon Appetit!

02:32.780 --> 02:33.880
Saule...

02:33.880 --> 02:34.480
Huh?

02:35.010 --> 02:37.150
Why didn't you wake me up, too?

02:37.150 --> 02:40.550
Well, we thought you'd be eating
breakfast with Waffle.

02:42.190 --> 02:45.860
That's fight! Houx-sama's
breakfast is right here!

02:46.420 --> 02:48.930
It's even more bizarre than
Chocolat-chan's cooking...

02:51.200 --> 02:53.430
Isn't that cute?
It's like you're playing house!

02:54.300 --> 02:55.690
Playing house?

02:55.690 --> 02:58.000
More like playing newlyweds.

02:58.000 --> 02:58.870
Saule!

03:00.170 --> 03:03.940
I get it, I get it. You wanted
to act like a grownup.

03:03.940 --> 03:05.940
I suppose you're at that age.

03:05.940 --> 03:07.910
You're completely mistaken!

03:07.910 --> 03:10.480
Please don't drag me
down to your level.

03:11.680 --> 03:15.190
I'm serious... very serious
about Houx-sama.

03:15.190 --> 03:18.020
I appreciate your feelings, but...

03:18.020 --> 03:21.690
Houx, one bite's not going to kill you.
Don't you feel bad for her?

03:21.690 --> 03:22.630
Here!

03:23.400 --> 03:23.830
Here.

03:29.830 --> 03:32.070
W-water! Gimme water!

03:32.070 --> 03:33.640
Uhh, Waffle...

03:35.970 --> 03:41.110
Umm... I have to go to school,
so I can't keep you company.

03:42.110 --> 03:44.080
I'm off!

03:44.380 --> 03:47.750
Ahh! Look at how much
of his breakfast Houx-sama didn't eat!

03:47.750 --> 03:51.490
And then there's Chocolat,
treating me like a child!

03:51.490 --> 03:53.020
I won't stand for it!

03:53.020 --> 03:55.160
What you say is true.

03:55.160 --> 03:59.130
True, Chocolat's a little more
grown up than me, but still...

04:00.100 --> 04:03.670
Say, Nana? If Chocolat were
more childish than me,

04:03.670 --> 04:07.240
wouldn't Houx-sama
fall in love with me?

04:07.240 --> 04:08.140
Hmm...

04:08.140 --> 04:13.340
Make Chocolat more childish
than me! You can do it, right?

04:14.380 --> 04:16.180
B-but...

04:16.180 --> 04:17.110
You can't?

04:17.120 --> 04:23.690
I understand. The magic is a little
complicated, but I'll give it a try.

04:28.090 --> 04:32.600
There's nothing I can't do!

04:40.110 --> 04:44.070
I've done it, Waffle-sama!

04:45.040 --> 04:46.410
Isn't that just an apple?

04:46.410 --> 04:52.580
But it has outstanding power!
If you take just one bite,

04:52.580 --> 04:57.090
your age will be halved before
you even realize it!

04:57.090 --> 04:58.460
Really?!

05:03.060 --> 05:08.130
If Chocolat becomes more of a kid
than me, Houx-sama will be mine!

05:17.180 --> 05:18.640
Huh? Coming!

05:20.550 --> 05:21.340
Umm...

05:21.340 --> 05:24.620
Need you any apples here?

05:24.620 --> 05:25.920
Come again?

05:25.920 --> 05:28.290
Here, an apple for you.

05:28.290 --> 05:29.120
Uhh, it's okay...

05:29.120 --> 05:32.160
It's a very delicious apple!

05:32.160 --> 05:35.030
Only grown in select areas
for a limited time!

05:35.030 --> 05:39.630
With just one bite, its gushing flavor
will infect your mind forever!

05:39.630 --> 05:41.130
I-is that so?

05:41.130 --> 05:43.100
I'll make it cheap just for you!

05:43.100 --> 05:47.600
And they're on special today.
two apples as a present!

05:48.540 --> 05:51.640
Please do have your
friend eat one too! Bye!

05:53.980 --> 05:55.610
What's wrong, Vanilla?

05:55.610 --> 05:59.150
Oh, nothing. Waffle...

05:59.150 --> 06:01.650
Oh, nothing. Waffle... was just here.

06:01.650 --> 06:05.320
She had a weird costume on and
said we should eat these apples.

06:05.320 --> 06:06.620
Apples?

06:06.620 --> 06:10.460
Mayby she wanted to make up for
what happened this morning.

06:10.460 --> 06:11.200
Huh?

06:11.200 --> 06:15.770
Remember? Waffle said some
nasty things to you earlier,

06:15.770 --> 06:18.400
and she felt guilty about that.

06:18.400 --> 06:21.910
I see... She couldn't just come
out and say "I'm sorry",

06:21.910 --> 06:24.110
so she went to all that trouble
to disguise herself.

06:24.110 --> 06:25.740
She does have her cute points!

06:25.740 --> 06:28.140
Yeah! She might
actually be a good girl!

06:28.140 --> 06:31.280
We went through times like that, too.

06:31.280 --> 06:33.880
Vanilla, you were an even bigger
crybaby than you are now.

06:34.190 --> 06:36.090
It was lonely at La Palais,

06:36.090 --> 06:39.120
so playing with you was the one
thing I looked forward to.

06:39.120 --> 06:41.860
Yeah. Well, since we've
got 'em, let's eat 'em!

06:41.860 --> 06:42.620
Okay!

06:42.620 --> 06:43.890
Yes!

06:47.870 --> 06:49.100
Delicious!

06:53.470 --> 06:55.040
Huh? What's this...

06:55.040 --> 06:56.640
weird feeling...

06:57.840 --> 07:00.100
Woohoo! Victory is mine!

07:11.220 --> 07:13.910
Where am I?!  Huh?

07:17.960 --> 07:21.670
Be sure to take your
afternoon nap, Vanilla-sama.

07:21.670 --> 07:24.800
Vanilla? Don't tell me that kid is...

07:24.800 --> 07:26.750
I'm not sleepy.

07:26.750 --> 07:31.010
It's so that you'll become a beautiful
woman.  You mustn't be selfish.

07:31.490 --> 07:32.210
Hmph.

07:32.210 --> 07:36.610
Please don't make me angry.
Now, close your eyes.

07:37.680 --> 07:40.320
Have a nice nap, Vanilla-sama.

07:51.160 --> 07:54.160
This room's so big.
I can't sleep in here.

07:54.670 --> 07:57.400
I knew it! That's Vanilla
when she was little.

07:57.700 --> 08:03.210
Which means...
they didn't get younger,

08:03.210 --> 08:06.740
but instead I got sent back to a
time when they were younger!

08:06.740 --> 08:11.000
Sheesh! Nana's always so
careless with her magic!

08:14.590 --> 08:17.990
2nd Lieutenant Robin and
2nd Lieutenant Glacier...

08:18.420 --> 08:21.990
Please keep a close watch
on Vanilla-sama's room.

08:21.990 --> 08:22.990
Yes Ma'am!

08:22.990 --> 08:28.730
I'm counting on you to ensure she takes
her afternoon nap like I told her to.

08:28.730 --> 08:30.430
Leave it to us.

08:35.110 --> 08:38.710
She didn't tell you to take a nap!

08:38.710 --> 08:40.640
I had a late night.

08:40.650 --> 08:45.120
Plus, sitting around here guarding
the princess bores me to sleep.

08:45.420 --> 08:47.850
You never cease to amaze me.

08:47.850 --> 08:51.890
You rock and roll all night, and party every day, just because you think this is an easy post.

08:54.290 --> 08:58.900
Fine, I get it. Next time, I'll invite you
to come along. Don't be jealous.

08:58.900 --> 09:00.360
Are you retarded?

09:16.310 --> 09:17.510
Chocolat-chan?

09:20.620 --> 09:22.020
Yo, Vanilla!

09:35.770 --> 09:39.510
I knew you wouldn't be able to sleep,
so I came up here to play.

09:40.040 --> 09:43.770
You came all the way to the top of
this tower just to play with me?

09:44.210 --> 09:49.280
It's impossible to get up here without
adult-level flight magic.

09:49.280 --> 09:50.750
Tadaa!

09:50.750 --> 09:52.480
This is Rainbow Flight Sand.

09:52.480 --> 09:54.490
I "borrowed" it from my grandpa.

09:54.490 --> 09:57.760
We can go anywhere we want,
as long as we have this!

09:57.760 --> 10:01.240
Vanilla, didn't you say you've always
wanted to play outside La Palais?

10:01.590 --> 10:04.760
Ah, Chocolat-chan!

10:04.760 --> 10:09.300
Look at you, crying again! C'mon,
get ready. We're heading out!

10:09.300 --> 10:12.770
But there are guards outside.

10:14.610 --> 10:19.090
Don't worry. Getting past those
lame-o geezers will be a snap.

10:20.950 --> 10:23.110
Princess, is something the matter?

10:25.950 --> 10:27.520
Pardon my intrusion.

10:31.920 --> 10:33.120
Just my imagination.

10:38.760 --> 10:40.160
I want to take an afternoon nap, too.

10:46.040 --> 10:47.700
That was close!

10:51.680 --> 10:53.740
The sand spilled out!

10:54.980 --> 10:56.650
My bed's flying!

10:57.220 --> 10:59.380
This is the power of
the Rainbow Flight Sand.

11:00.050 --> 11:02.350
Let's go with the flow
and fly on the bed!

11:02.350 --> 11:05.390
What? But I'm still in my pajamas!

11:05.390 --> 11:07.090
Who cares? Not me!

11:07.090 --> 11:09.110
Let's go!

11:13.630 --> 11:15.850
Awesome!

11:16.130 --> 11:19.290
La Palais is getting
smaller and smaller!

11:27.700 --> 11:30.350
That girl is good, and this girl is good too

11:30.350 --> 11:32.000
It's so very hard to choose.

11:33.020 --> 11:35.690
That guy is bad, and this guy is bad

11:35.690 --> 11:37.310
Jealousy will drive them mad.

11:40.950 --> 11:43.610
Dresses are nice, ribbons are nice too

11:43.610 --> 11:45.200
Blue jeans just won't do!

11:46.310 --> 11:48.910
How about a kiss, what about tomorrow?

11:48.910 --> 11:50.620
"I will not let you go home"

11:54.610 --> 11:56.790
Why is it that all boys

11:56.790 --> 11:58.790
are always the same

11:58.790 --> 12:02.660
and drive me up the wall?

12:02.660 --> 12:06.260
I don't get them at all...

12:13.080 --> 12:15.600
Making big plans and going on dates

12:15.600 --> 12:17.280
from one town to the next.

12:18.230 --> 12:20.990
Sitting on swingsets, staying up real late

12:20.990 --> 12:22.650
having our little chats.

12:26.320 --> 12:28.950
Whispering voices, in between the bedsheets

12:28.950 --> 12:30.580
Little kisses are so sweet.

12:31.630 --> 12:34.290
Somebody kill the lights in the room, cause

12:34.290 --> 12:35.750
Mama's gonna wake up soon.

12:36.920 --> 12:39.500
Somebody kill the lights in the room, cause

12:39.500 --> 12:41.300
Mama's gonna wake up soon.

12:42.300 --> 12:44.050
Mama's gonna wake up soon.

12:44.970 --> 12:46.640
Mama's gonna wake up soon.

12:54.630 --> 12:55.900
Mmm, so sweet!

12:56.430 --> 12:58.900
Who knew these clouds
were made of candy?

12:58.900 --> 13:00.640
I sure didn't.

13:00.640 --> 13:03.570
And there might be other cool
stuff around here, too!

13:03.570 --> 13:06.910
Where should we go next? We
can go anywhere you'd like.

13:07.410 --> 13:10.410
But aren't you scared,
Chocolat-chan?

13:10.980 --> 13:13.890
Nope! I'm having fun
because we're together.

13:13.890 --> 13:15.150
What about you, Vanilla?

13:15.650 --> 13:18.660
I... umm...

13:20.160 --> 13:23.890
The truth is, I've always wanted
to travel freely like this,

13:24.560 --> 13:27.550
But I'd given up because I
thought it was impossible.

13:29.100 --> 13:32.900
Chocolat-chan is really incredible.
She can even make dreams come true.

13:34.810 --> 13:35.870
I'm having fun too.

13:35.870 --> 13:36.910
Eh? What was that?

13:37.680 --> 13:39.040
Ouch... Huh?

13:40.650 --> 13:41.550
A star?

13:48.250 --> 13:50.890
Somehow, we wound up
at the Star Field.

13:50.890 --> 13:52.360
Star Field?

13:52.360 --> 13:53.060
Yeah.

13:53.060 --> 13:57.300
See? Those people over there
must be the Star-tisans.

13:57.300 --> 14:01.060
They cut out tons of stars
to decorate the sky.

14:02.030 --> 14:06.070
So the stars in the Magical World
are made by these people.

14:06.070 --> 14:09.110
Ha ha, I snagged a star.

14:09.110 --> 14:12.580
I'm so sorry for dropping that star!

14:12.580 --> 14:14.050
May I please have it back?

14:14.050 --> 14:17.280
Hmph! Just when I
finally snagged one...

14:17.280 --> 14:20.950
If the clouds are made of candy, maybe
file stars taste even better!

14:20.950 --> 14:22.550
Let me take a bite first!

14:22.550 --> 14:24.050
Ah! Don't do that!

14:34.030 --> 14:37.370
Ah! There are stars shooting
out of your body!

14:37.370 --> 14:39.800
I told her not to eat the star.

14:39.800 --> 14:42.310
What should I do, Vanilla?

14:42.310 --> 14:43.540
Chocolat-chan...

14:44.280 --> 14:47.180
I'll be taking this. See ya!

14:47.180 --> 14:49.010
Wait, Mr. Star-tisan!

14:49.010 --> 14:51.520
Well, back to the grind.

14:51.520 --> 14:55.220
Aww, the stars keep shooting out!

14:55.220 --> 14:56.750
What should we do now?

14:58.220 --> 15:00.320
They're not stopping!

15:06.430 --> 15:09.430
Somebody help us!!

15:11.640 --> 15:15.570
Who is it? Who dares raise their
voice above our forest?

15:16.870 --> 15:19.180
Ah, Chocolat?

15:19.180 --> 15:20.810
Houx, Saule!

15:22.050 --> 15:23.780
What happened to you, Chocolat?

15:23.780 --> 15:26.150
You've got stars
shooting out of your body.

15:26.150 --> 15:29.140
I take one little bite of a star,
and look what I get for it...

15:29.140 --> 15:31.020
Typical Chocolat!

15:31.020 --> 15:34.560
Well, you'll go back to normal
once all the stars come out.

15:35.330 --> 15:36.560
Thank goodness!

15:36.560 --> 15:37.860
Who's she?

15:37.860 --> 15:39.900
Wait, isn't that the princess?

15:39.900 --> 15:40.750
It's Vanilla!

15:41.730 --> 15:42.730
Y-Yes, I am.

15:42.730 --> 15:46.800
These two are my longtime
friends, Houx and Saule.

15:47.270 --> 15:48.870
We know all about you, Vanilla.

15:49.510 --> 15:52.010
You're Chocolat's best friend, right?

15:53.080 --> 15:55.580
Nice to meet you. I'm Vanilla.

15:57.150 --> 16:00.020
Nice to meet you, Vanilla. I'm Houx.

16:00.020 --> 16:01.280
I'm Saule.

16:03.350 --> 16:07.290
Finally! The stars are all gone.

16:07.830 --> 16:11.360
Hey, let's take Vanilla "there."

16:11.360 --> 16:13.030
It'll blow her mind!

16:13.030 --> 16:14.300
No problem.

16:14.300 --> 16:15.700
Okay. Let's go!

16:31.320 --> 16:32.480
Incredible!

16:32.480 --> 16:36.120
Who knew there was such a dreamlike
place in the Magical World?

16:36.120 --> 16:38.710
This is Houx and Saule's
top-secret place.

16:38.990 --> 16:41.960
Yeah, nobody else knows about
it yet, except for Chocolat.

16:43.160 --> 16:44.140
Then I'm...

16:44.140 --> 16:49.430
We thought we could tell you,
since you're Chocolat's best friend.

16:50.430 --> 16:51.400
Thank you!

16:53.100 --> 16:55.440
Hey, let's play Treasure Hunt!

16:56.170 --> 16:58.710
Treasure Hunt? Yeah, let's do it!

16:59.910 --> 17:03.750
There's something very rare
and valuable inside this.

17:04.120 --> 17:06.480
Ah, Saule, not that!

17:06.480 --> 17:09.220
First one to find it wins!

17:09.220 --> 17:10.250
And away!

17:14.590 --> 17:16.460
Ooh! What could it be?

17:17.060 --> 17:19.430
Come hunt with us, Vanilla!

17:20.160 --> 17:20.760
Let's go!

17:27.000 --> 17:27.700
What's this?

17:28.470 --> 17:32.880
See? You're just fine. It feels like you're
flying inside this Prism Pool.

17:32.880 --> 17:35.550
Yeah. My body feels lighter than air!

17:35.550 --> 17:38.550
All right! Time to start!

17:38.550 --> 17:40.050
Saule, wait up!

17:42.320 --> 17:44.060
Hmm, I don't see it.

17:44.060 --> 17:48.550
*kick* *stroke* *kick* *stroke*

17:49.130 --> 17:51.430
Hey Houx, what's inside that thing?

17:51.430 --> 17:52.860
That's a secret.

17:52.860 --> 17:56.530
If that's how you're gonna be,
I've got to find it and see for myself!

18:06.040 --> 18:08.560
Huh? I wound up someplace strange...

18:34.480 --> 18:36.070
Found it!

18:36.470 --> 18:38.740
Nice job, Chocolat!

18:39.210 --> 18:41.050
Chocolat-chan,
you really are incredible!

18:42.550 --> 18:45.480
This treasure is now mine forever!

18:46.050 --> 18:48.270
Hey! It won't open...

18:49.390 --> 18:50.450
Houx...

18:51.360 --> 18:52.790
I'll open it.

18:55.320 --> 18:56.820
Hurry! Hurry!

18:59.560 --> 19:02.070
Oh no! Nap time is over!

19:02.070 --> 19:05.600
We have to return to La Palais before
Nana gets back to the room!

19:05.600 --> 19:07.070
Oh, this is so bad!

19:07.070 --> 19:09.070
Let's head back, Vanilla!

19:11.980 --> 19:12.680
Eh?

19:12.680 --> 19:13.740
You're leaving?

19:13.740 --> 19:16.250
Houx, Soul, see you later!

19:24.360 --> 19:26.850
Ro-Robin, wake up!

19:28.360 --> 19:29.930
Huh? What?

19:29.930 --> 19:32.360
The princess...
Vanilla-sama is missing!

19:34.570 --> 19:37.540
I completely missed
the Princess leaving her room.

19:37.540 --> 19:41.270
It looks like we're in for some
major punishment this time.

19:41.710 --> 19:42.970
Let's hurry up and search!

19:45.480 --> 19:48.480
Is there something out of the
ordinary, gentlemen?

19:48.480 --> 19:49.310
Ma'am!

19:49.310 --> 19:51.480
No... Nothing.

19:51.480 --> 19:52.670
Probably.

19:52.670 --> 19:54.980
I don't like the sound
of that "probably"!

19:59.060 --> 20:00.260
Vanilla-sama...

20:00.260 --> 20:00.960
Oh no!

20:02.590 --> 20:04.590
I had a great nap, Nana!

20:05.800 --> 20:08.060
I'm so happy to hear that.

20:11.800 --> 20:13.900
It seems like we...

20:13.900 --> 20:15.970
aren't in trouble.

20:22.180 --> 20:25.700
Waffle... Waffle...
wake up already!

20:26.020 --> 20:27.450
What's with Waffle?

20:27.890 --> 20:29.350
We're not sure.

20:29.350 --> 20:32.720
After she dropped by to give us
some apples, she fell asleep.

20:34.120 --> 20:36.690
Waffle's pretty cute...
when she's asleep!

20:36.690 --> 20:39.730
Well, there's no harm in letting
her sleep a little more.

20:40.530 --> 20:41.730
Guess not!

20:43.930 --> 20:46.600
It seems like I mixed
up the magic spells...

20:46.600 --> 20:50.370
for turning the apple's
eater into a child...

20:50.370 --> 20:53.020
and for seeing a dream
of the eater's childhood.

20:54.310 --> 20:57.450
Hey Houx, doesn't this
bring back memories?

20:57.450 --> 20:58.480
Yeah...

20:58.480 --> 21:02.050
You put all that work into
a gift you couldn't give.

21:02.050 --> 21:05.990
I even set up the treasure hunt
so that Chocolat would find it.

21:05.990 --> 21:09.290
It's a guardian egg charm that can
only be made with a forest spirit.

21:09.290 --> 21:13.160
It can only be made for and given
to the person you love the most.

21:13.160 --> 21:17.470
Didn't it take you several months
and lots of effort to make it?

21:18.670 --> 21:21.540
Yeah, I even engraved
Chocolat's name on it.

21:24.810 --> 21:27.880
But just so you know,
I love Chocolat more than you do.

21:28.750 --> 21:30.110
No, I love her more.

21:34.810 --> 21:36.600
GOOD MORNING!!

21:36.950 --> 21:38.360
You again?!

21:39.360 --> 21:44.630
Today, I'll have you eat the breakfast
I made if it's the last thing I do!

21:44.630 --> 21:47.060
